<title>USA: Stoffer named president of NICOR Energy venture.</title>
<headline>Stoffer named president of NICOR Energy venture.</headline>
<dateline>NAPERVILLE, Ill. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>NICOR Inc and NGC Corp said Friday Kevin Stoffer was named president of the companies' joint venture, NICOR Energy LLC.</p>
<p>The venture was created to offer natural gas, electricity and related services to industrial, commercial and residential customers in the U.S. Midwest.</p>
<p>Stoffer previously served as vice president and general manager of UtiliCorp United Inc's Energy Services Division.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
